    -- loading, the tile shows the item name.
    -- The files must be REAL images (PNG / JPEG). WebP files renamed to .png are
    -- rejected (see imgKind / ALLOW_WEBP below).
    -- Failed downloads are retried every IMG_RETRY seconds.
    -- FADE: the whole panel fades in when it goes onto a player and fades out when it
